From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eryk Wieliczko <eryk@wieliczko.ninja>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:01:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple,pmp: add the T8132 PMP

Describe the M4 PMP, compatible with the T6000 PMP v2 interface like
the T8140 one.

Source-commit: 9251bffee1094e1c36b9f084546b828a7d2c768e
Source-snapshot: 9ffa1fbed1e052d9706ad3e13c8663bc8ffe3d8d
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit b811bfe35dd8405a2c7112d9b3b3911b69be69c9,
 subset: the apple,t8132-pmp-v2 entry of apple,pmp.yaml; the enum it
 joins is created here, since omacom does not carry the T6041 entry of
 aurora c9c779d6a; the other controller variants of that commit are
 covered by omacom #332 or not needed for the GPU path)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,pmp.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,pmp.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,pmp.yaml
index fbf63358fc..ec1d648e69 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,pmp.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,pmp.yaml
@@ -20,7 +20,9 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - const: apple,t6000-pmp-v2
       - items:
-          - const: apple,t8140-pmp-v2
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t8132-pmp-v2
+              - apple,t8140-pmp-v2
           - const: apple,t6000-pmp-v2
 
   reg:
